WEBVTT

01:28.440 --> 01:35.270
Our Secret
EP14

01:36.649 --> 01:37.970
In this exam,

01:38.330 --> 01:39.480
the performance of our class

01:39.730 --> 01:40.920
is very satisfying.

01:41.410 --> 01:43.240
A couple of students

01:43.520 --> 01:45.280
have made obvious progress.

01:46.450 --> 01:47.090
Ding Xian,

01:47.649 --> 01:49.010
538.

01:49.369 --> 01:49.880
Excellent.

01:50.280 --> 01:51.970
Keep it up.

01:57.730 --> 01:59.770
Sun Jiacheng,

02:00.840 --> 02:01.920
559.

03:04.290 --> 03:05.210
Hello everyone,

03:05.720 --> 03:07.410
I am Zhou Siyue from Senior Three Class Three.

03:14.520 --> 03:15.930
Perhaps many students

03:16.080 --> 03:17.770
have had this kind of moments.

03:19.130 --> 03:20.969
You may think the article of classical Chinese is so long,

03:22.080 --> 03:23.360
and the math problems

03:23.640 --> 03:24.440
are so difficult.

03:25.440 --> 03:27.440
We feel sleepy every day,

03:27.930 --> 03:30.570
because we can't even sleep for six hours every day.

03:31.410 --> 03:33.690
Every two day we run out of

03:33.690 --> 03:35.520
the ink of a brand new gel pen.

03:37.000 --> 03:39.160
In days exhausting our life like these,

03:39.520 --> 03:41.490
I always ask myself one question.

03:42.410 --> 03:44.490
Does everything we are doing now

03:44.640 --> 03:46.160
really worth it?

03:48.969 --> 03:50.000
But it is exactly

03:50.719 --> 03:53.000
in these insipid and dull days

03:54.160 --> 03:56.000
that we meet the group of people,

03:57.130 --> 03:58.640
lovely and kind, around us.

04:02.880 --> 04:05.520
We share the same goal,

04:07.000 --> 04:08.330
and we together

04:08.330 --> 04:11.000
work hard

04:11.160 --> 04:12.240
towards this goal.

04:29.850 --> 04:32.800
Within the broad space and infinite time,

04:34.080 --> 04:35.890
even if we end up in separation,

04:36.890 --> 04:38.920
looking up at the stars with you,

04:39.890 --> 04:42.410
is already the best thing happened in my life.

04:48.799 --> 04:50.610
So, just keep moving forward.

04:51.320 --> 04:52.360
Don't be afraid.

04:53.170 --> 04:56.080
Those days after days that may seem little to you

04:56.080 --> 04:57.970
will make you understand the meaning of persistence

04:58.080 --> 05:00.360
one day in the future.

05:03.130 --> 05:05.240
I always believe in one sentence,

05:06.480 --> 05:08.450
"there is still glory on the other side."

07:01.240 --> 07:02.450
Why are you here?

07:03.040 --> 07:04.200
Who are you expecting then?

07:05.480 --> 07:06.010
How was it?

07:06.320 --> 07:07.890
Where do you want to go after the exam?

07:09.170 --> 07:10.610
I want to get drunk.

07:11.080 --> 07:11.800
Okay.

07:13.570 --> 07:15.360
I happen to know some nice places.

07:15.610 --> 07:17.080
We can call Song Ziqi and the others.

07:17.800 --> 07:18.730
No. No.

07:18.890 --> 07:20.290
Just Shasha and me will be fine.

07:21.170 --> 07:22.640
We girls have a lot to talk about.

07:23.890 --> 07:24.570
Let's go.

07:30.760 --> 07:31.970
Cheers!

07:36.890 --> 07:38.850
You couldn't drink in this way.

07:40.890 --> 07:41.730
What's going on?

07:45.170 --> 07:46.890
I don't know.

07:47.730 --> 07:50.450
My brain went blank when I was taking the exam.

07:51.480 --> 07:53.290
I couldn't recall anything.

07:57.290 --> 07:59.080
Same. Me too.

07:59.080 --> 08:01.410
I couldn't answer many questions.

08:02.480 --> 08:03.760
Now that the exam is over,

08:04.200 --> 08:05.640
stop thinking about these anymore.

08:09.360 --> 08:10.520
There is no chance for me.

08:12.080 --> 08:12.850
It's fine. It's fine.

08:12.970 --> 08:13.800
It's fine. It's fine.

08:16.920 --> 08:19.450
I thought I could be closer to Zhou Siyue.

08:21.080 --> 08:23.640
I have studied so hard.

08:25.890 --> 08:29.410
Finally I still failed, Shadi.

08:29.410 --> 08:32.730
I'll never keep up with him, won't I?

08:41.760 --> 08:43.170
You fool.

08:45.640 --> 08:46.930
You said I was a fool?

08:47.320 --> 08:48.410
You are a fool yourself.

08:48.560 --> 08:50.370
You like Song Ziqi, don't you?

08:50.730 --> 08:52.520
I don't.

08:52.930 --> 08:53.810
Just

08:54.320 --> 08:56.970
as soon as I think of our parting,

08:57.640 --> 08:58.610
I feel sad.

08:59.370 --> 09:00.410
That's all.

09:05.290 --> 09:06.170
Right.

09:07.440 --> 09:09.080
We are going to separate now.

09:11.000 --> 09:13.200
Not only Zhou Siyue and I are separating,

09:15.200 --> 09:16.120
but also you and me,

09:16.730 --> 09:17.760
Song Ziqi,

09:17.930 --> 09:19.200
and You Keke.

09:21.440 --> 09:23.000
We are all about to be parted.

09:27.560 --> 09:30.200
Why... Why are you talking about this so early?

09:30.560 --> 09:32.410
I have never thought about these.

09:34.810 --> 09:35.640
Forget about these.

09:39.760 --> 09:40.640
Xianxian

09:42.370 --> 09:44.370
If we could restart our high school life,

09:46.250 --> 09:48.410
I would be your best friend on day one.

09:53.520 --> 09:54.410
Me too.

09:58.520 --> 10:00.200
We must be friends forever.

10:01.320 --> 10:03.120
Don't forget me when you go to the university.

10:04.000 --> 10:05.080
You too.

10:09.080 --> 10:11.320
Why are you crying so ugly again?

10:11.680 --> 10:13.170
You are the ugly one.

10:14.970 --> 10:15.930
Well, well.

10:18.730 --> 10:19.640
Let's sing.

10:20.410 --> 10:21.080
Sing.

10:45.320 --> 10:46.520
Shadi

10:47.440 --> 10:50.760
I really don't want to separate with you.

10:51.410 --> 10:52.370
Then let's go back.

10:54.850 --> 10:55.930
Let me take a rest.

11:00.370 --> 11:01.760
Zhou Siyue

11:04.880 --> 11:06.370
Zhou Siyue

11:08.680 --> 11:10.200
Ding Xian, you are so funny.

11:10.520 --> 11:12.760
You mistake the trash can for Zhou Siyue.

11:14.120 --> 11:15.970
He is Zhou Siyue.

11:18.200 --> 11:20.730
Look, he is over there.

11:21.760 --> 11:22.930
Liar.

11:25.520 --> 11:26.290
Ding Xian

11:38.440 --> 11:39.050
Come over here.

11:39.640 --> 11:40.560
You two make us uneasy.

11:40.560 --> 11:41.520
Siyue and I searched every shop.

11:41.520 --> 11:42.520
But we couldn't find you.

11:44.120 --> 11:45.250
I'll take her back home.

11:49.880 --> 11:50.850
Why are you ignoring me?

11:51.760 --> 11:53.520
I don't want to talk to you.

11:54.760 --> 11:57.370
After all, we are not deskmates

11:57.970 --> 11:59.200
or neighbors anymore.

11:59.560 --> 12:00.810
Who cares about you?

12:04.730 --> 12:05.440
You care about me.

12:07.170 --> 12:08.680
I want you to care about me all the time.

12:12.000 --> 12:12.610
Ouch.

12:13.120 --> 12:14.440
I don't want to care about you.

12:15.250 --> 12:15.970
Slow down.

12:17.170 --> 12:17.970
You.

12:19.490 --> 12:21.170
I don't want to go with you.

12:21.730 --> 12:23.930
You always walk so fast

12:24.810 --> 12:27.120
that I am left behind.

12:35.290 --> 12:37.200
How about you walking ahead of me from now on?

12:46.930 --> 12:49.560
Whether I walk ahead of you or behind you,

12:50.320 --> 12:52.680
I can't walk with you anymore.

12:59.080 --> 13:00.370
Stand up, ok?

13:04.440 --> 13:05.080
Come.

13:08.850 --> 13:09.520
Get on.

13:20.810 --> 13:22.560
Didn't we agree

13:23.200 --> 13:25.290
that we should face everything together?

13:29.410 --> 13:30.440
Siyue

13:32.440 --> 13:33.730
Zhou Siyue

13:35.320 --> 13:36.120
I'm here.

13:37.610 --> 13:39.730
I am always wondering,

13:40.250 --> 13:42.850
what will we be like

13:42.970 --> 13:44.730
when we are adults?

13:46.810 --> 13:50.120
Will we be like when we were in high school?

13:51.490 --> 13:54.290
Every day is simple and happy.

13:58.050 --> 13:58.760
We will.

14:00.730 --> 14:01.760
You are lying to me.

14:03.120 --> 14:06.370
People change after they get separated.

14:07.680 --> 14:09.080
Will we

14:09.170 --> 14:12.490
be strangers one day?

14:13.680 --> 14:16.370
Come off it. You're drunk.

14:17.080 --> 14:18.560
I'm not.

14:25.000 --> 14:26.200
Zhou Siyue

14:26.560 --> 14:28.760
Have you ever heard about this saying?

14:30.250 --> 14:33.170
"I'm not afraid that the moon will be shadowed by the clouds,

14:33.810 --> 14:36.610
for you are brighter than the stars."

14:38.730 --> 14:40.440
You future

14:41.490 --> 14:43.640
is just like the stars.

14:45.810 --> 14:47.250
Silly.

14:48.880 --> 14:50.850
Stars don't shine.

14:51.880 --> 14:53.290
I don't care.

15:00.850 --> 15:02.520
If I say they shine,

15:02.880 --> 15:04.320
they do.

15:16.320 --> 15:17.440
Silly.

15:24.730 --> 15:25.250
Open your mouth.

15:30.250 --> 15:31.760
Better? Have some more?

15:38.250 --> 15:39.410
Song Ziqi

15:40.810 --> 15:42.080
What should I do?

15:43.370 --> 15:44.880
After this vacation,

15:46.610 --> 15:48.410
I can't see you next term.

15:49.200 --> 15:50.730
We have been together since childhood

15:52.250 --> 15:53.410
for so many years.

15:54.970 --> 15:58.560
How can you live without me?

16:00.000 --> 16:01.050
It's okay.

16:01.120 --> 16:02.850
I'm fine. I'm fine.

16:03.640 --> 16:05.440
But I can't bully you anymore,

16:05.440 --> 16:06.810
and can't play tricks on you anymore.

16:07.000 --> 16:07.930
I'm fine.

16:08.170 --> 16:09.370
You are lying.

16:10.290 --> 16:12.080
You have been lying to me since we were kids.

16:12.730 --> 16:13.730
When did I lie to you?

16:14.730 --> 16:16.170
When I wet my pants

16:17.170 --> 16:18.880
once in kindergarten,

16:19.760 --> 16:22.250
you said I should stand on the playground

16:22.250 --> 16:23.760
for my pants would dry up faster that way.

16:25.760 --> 16:27.170
And when we were in primary school,

16:27.850 --> 16:30.560
you lied that girls also have beards.

16:30.560 --> 16:31.880
and let me to shave them with a razor.

16:32.080 --> 16:34.120
Then I got chased and beaten by my mom.

16:34.810 --> 16:36.880
Most egregious of all, during the senior high school entrance examination,

16:37.610 --> 16:39.970
you lied to me that the essential balm could help energize me,

16:40.320 --> 16:42.320
so that I should rub it on my eyelids.

16:43.680 --> 16:45.610
Song Ziqi, if you don't like me,

16:45.610 --> 16:47.880
you should just tell me.

16:48.930 --> 16:51.440
No, you listen to me.

16:51.930 --> 16:54.120
I, every time I see you,

16:54.120 --> 16:55.290
I find you interesting.

16:55.290 --> 16:56.520
That's why I want to play tricks on you.

16:56.640 --> 16:58.640
Are you an idiot?

17:00.170 --> 17:01.370
I let you do these to me for so long.

17:01.410 --> 17:03.610
Can't you see that I like you?

17:12.800 --> 17:17.040
You're always angry with me,

17:17.200 --> 17:18.200
beat me,

17:19.200 --> 17:20.770
tell me to do this and that,

17:20.890 --> 17:22.009
treat me as your underling.

17:22.009 --> 17:24.530
How can I tell that you like me?

17:24.530 --> 17:26.009
Don't change the subject.

17:27.650 --> 17:29.130
Just tell me.

17:30.800 --> 17:32.080
Do you like me?

17:46.130 --> 17:46.920
Kong Shadi

17:55.320 --> 17:56.370
For so many years,

17:58.800 --> 18:00.080
I have always been behind you.

18:03.730 --> 18:04.970
If I don't like you,

18:08.280 --> 18:09.440
whom will I like?

18:17.800 --> 18:18.560
Then

18:19.610 --> 18:21.920
are we going to have a long-distance relationship?

18:23.680 --> 18:24.800
It doesn't matter.

18:25.770 --> 18:26.370
Maybe

18:26.730 --> 18:27.650
when we're in a long-distance relationship,

18:28.680 --> 18:30.010
you'll find me more pleasant to be with.

18:30.800 --> 18:32.200
I am serious!

18:35.130 --> 18:35.850
Don't worry.

18:37.970 --> 18:39.040
Even if it's a long-distance relationship,

18:41.010 --> 18:42.200
I won't let you go.

18:46.970 --> 18:48.080
Then it's a deal.

18:48.970 --> 18:50.800
You need to call me every day.

18:51.440 --> 18:52.490
You can't miss my calls.

18:52.490 --> 18:53.370
Or my messages.

18:53.370 --> 18:53.890
Sure.

18:55.130 --> 18:57.320
We need to meet once a month.

18:58.200 --> 18:58.730
Sure.

18:59.560 --> 19:01.610
You can't lie to me or scold me.

19:01.850 --> 19:02.770
You need to care about me.

19:03.160 --> 19:03.680
Sure.

19:03.920 --> 19:05.560
If I am bullied,

19:05.970 --> 19:07.610
you should go to me as soon as possible.

19:10.730 --> 19:11.250
And,

19:11.370 --> 19:13.010
during festivals, anniversaries,

19:13.160 --> 19:15.160
and birthdays, you...

19:33.890 --> 19:35.370
What are you doing?

19:58.250 --> 20:00.560
Mom, you scared me.

20:01.650 --> 20:03.080
You silly girl,

20:03.850 --> 20:06.160
it is afternoon already. Get up now.

20:08.010 --> 20:10.200
I called you yesterday, but you didn't pick up.

20:10.400 --> 20:12.730
You got home so late and drunk.

20:13.010 --> 20:15.200
How free you are after the exam.

20:16.200 --> 20:18.160
Then how did I get home?

20:18.440 --> 20:20.280
Siyue brought you home.

20:25.770 --> 20:26.770
Get up quickly.

20:29.490 --> 20:30.530
How was the exam?

20:31.440 --> 20:32.530
Have you estimated your scores?

20:37.250 --> 20:38.250
Not yet.

20:40.890 --> 20:42.680
Mom, I need to wash my face first.

22:13.010 --> 22:13.850
Ding Xian

22:14.400 --> 22:16.280
Your teacher said that your score

22:16.560 --> 22:17.920
can be enrolled in Hangzhou's key universities.

22:19.560 --> 22:20.250
Mom.

22:21.650 --> 22:23.370
I'm not going to apply for universities.

22:24.080 --> 22:25.010
What did you say?

22:25.530 --> 22:26.970
I said I'm not going to apply for universities.

22:29.890 --> 22:30.730
I want to be in school for another year.

22:31.280 --> 22:32.770
You can go to a key university already,

22:34.490 --> 22:35.730
but still want to pay to study for another year, right?

22:36.370 --> 22:37.650
Did too much study break your brain?

22:38.160 --> 22:39.010
I could have done better

22:39.010 --> 22:40.400
in this exam.

22:41.280 --> 22:42.200
I can't be reconciled.

22:42.680 --> 22:43.370
I don't agree.

22:44.280 --> 22:45.320
I'll ask your teacher now

22:45.320 --> 22:46.040
to fill the application form for you.

22:46.370 --> 22:47.490
Don't even think of another year.

22:47.800 --> 22:48.530
Mom.

22:49.200 --> 22:50.730
Can you just leave me alone?

22:51.680 --> 22:53.730
This is my life, not yours.

22:55.320 --> 22:57.200
Can you for once let me make my own decision?

22:58.130 --> 23:00.440
No matter the result is good or bad, I'll take it.

23:01.890 --> 23:02.490
Okay?

23:05.770 --> 23:06.530
Fine.

23:08.770 --> 23:10.160
From now on,

23:10.490 --> 23:11.440
I will not mind your business.

23:18.320 --> 23:19.530
Rest assured.

23:20.200 --> 23:22.920
I have packed my luggage.

23:23.920 --> 23:25.560
We'll go to you this afternoon.

23:27.730 --> 23:30.530
We should stay by your side at this kind of moment.

23:33.400 --> 23:33.970
Okay.

23:35.280 --> 23:35.890
See you.

23:39.920 --> 23:40.650
What happened, mom?

23:41.850 --> 23:42.560
Are you going out?

23:47.160 --> 23:47.850
Siyue,

23:48.800 --> 23:49.610
have a seat.

23:50.370 --> 23:51.560
Let me tell you something.

23:55.320 --> 23:55.970
What happened?

23:58.490 --> 23:59.280
Siyue,

24:00.250 --> 24:03.560
we're going to Jiangling early than expected.

24:07.490 --> 24:08.490
Is it because

24:10.040 --> 24:11.400
something happened to Dad?

24:15.530 --> 24:16.680
It's a little complex

24:17.280 --> 24:18.970
to explain.

24:20.130 --> 24:21.850
I see.

24:31.530 --> 24:33.400
Mom, I need to go out for a while.

24:33.530 --> 24:34.200
I'll be back soon.

24:34.890 --> 24:35.530
Just go.

24:57.040 --> 24:58.160
I failed in the exam.

25:02.280 --> 25:03.650
I can't go to Jiangling.

25:06.490 --> 25:07.560
Then, where do you apply to?

25:09.400 --> 25:10.400
I plan to

25:12.850 --> 25:13.560
study for another year.

25:14.200 --> 25:15.010
Another year?

25:20.400 --> 25:22.200
You can wait for me in Huaqing University.

25:24.040 --> 25:25.130
Maybe

25:25.560 --> 25:26.800
I can outdo myself.

25:29.200 --> 25:30.370
And I can go find you then.

25:39.440 --> 25:40.040
All right.

25:45.400 --> 25:46.610
Actually I have one thing

25:46.610 --> 25:47.730
to tell you.

25:52.280 --> 25:53.800
I'm leaving soon.

26:00.610 --> 26:02.370
Will you be back during the vacation?

26:04.250 --> 26:05.080
I'm afraid...

26:06.560 --> 26:07.440
not.

26:11.370 --> 26:12.200
Fine.

26:17.890 --> 26:19.160
I will miss you.

26:33.400 --> 26:34.560
I should leave now.

26:36.530 --> 26:37.770
I am going to start

26:37.770 --> 26:39.560
a new round of senior three life tomorrow.

26:39.730 --> 26:40.250
Wait.

26:43.920 --> 26:45.890
I have a parting gift for you.

26:59.250 --> 27:01.730
Isn't this the D2-T3 robot

27:02.250 --> 27:04.250
you showed me last time?

27:06.970 --> 27:07.800
Good for you.

27:08.680 --> 27:09.730
You still remember this.

27:12.200 --> 27:14.560
Why is it called D2-T3?

27:15.250 --> 27:17.010
I named it randomly.

27:20.560 --> 27:22.370
Then let me give it a name.

27:24.920 --> 27:27.040
Good. What do you want to call it?

27:32.680 --> 27:33.320
April.

27:36.160 --> 27:37.160
April?

27:40.370 --> 27:41.730
I will always remember

27:42.920 --> 27:44.920
the summer of my 18.

27:45.800 --> 27:47.160
Extremely hot.

27:47.890 --> 27:49.320
And extremely difficult to endure.

27:51.040 --> 27:52.400
The past

27:53.490 --> 27:56.080
is saying goodbye to me.

27:56.970 --> 27:58.160
All I can do

27:59.130 --> 28:00.530
is to face it frankly.

28:02.010 --> 28:05.560
Smile and say goodbye to it.

28:29.490 --> 28:30.280
Xianxian

28:31.200 --> 28:32.560
Here's the thing.

28:33.400 --> 28:34.770
Mr. Wang of senior three,

28:34.770 --> 28:35.970
is always the head teacher of the key class,

28:36.370 --> 28:38.280
and his class has a very high university enrollment rate.

28:38.680 --> 28:40.040
Your mom and I thought it over.

28:40.850 --> 28:41.610
Maybe

28:41.850 --> 28:43.970
you can study in his class this year?

28:45.250 --> 28:48.490
Okay. I also heard that he's amazing.

28:48.890 --> 28:50.920
Perhaps I can make bigger progress.

28:51.490 --> 28:52.130
Great.

28:53.280 --> 28:53.970
I need to go.

28:54.370 --> 28:56.010
Finish quickly and go to school.

28:56.010 --> 28:58.320
Dad, I'm almost done.

28:58.850 --> 29:00.010
Let's go together.

29:02.080 --> 29:02.890
Sure.

29:03.130 --> 29:03.920
Go.

29:03.920 --> 29:04.650
I'll take it.

29:06.080 --> 29:06.530
Go.

29:07.010 --> 29:07.730
We are leaving.

29:24.610 --> 29:25.130
Okay.

29:25.800 --> 29:26.280
Everyone,

29:27.320 --> 29:27.890
Let's cut the chase.

29:28.530 --> 29:30.280
As to the tension of senior three,

29:30.770 --> 29:32.200
I believe that you guys know it well already.

29:32.850 --> 29:33.490
I

29:33.610 --> 29:35.650
will not do empty talks with you.

29:36.400 --> 29:37.040
But

29:38.370 --> 29:39.400
I have one request.

29:42.680 --> 29:46.530
Fill in your dream university seriously.

29:47.160 --> 29:50.890
Work hard towards it from now on.

29:52.040 --> 29:55.370
We have a couple of old students in our class.

29:55.970 --> 29:57.650
I hope you

29:57.970 --> 29:59.370
can face the past,

30:00.080 --> 30:01.400
review yourself,

30:02.200 --> 30:03.680
and make better choice this time.

30:09.250 --> 30:10.530
My new term started.

30:11.770 --> 30:12.800
I feel that I am

30:12.800 --> 30:14.280
further away from the guys.

30:15.890 --> 30:18.010
Everyone is following the normal track

30:18.010 --> 30:19.200
and moving forward,

30:20.280 --> 30:24.010
while only I seem to go off track.

30:25.650 --> 30:28.370
I missed

30:29.080 --> 30:30.200
Zhou Siyue and the others.

30:32.080 --> 30:35.010
Though these days are tough

30:35.920 --> 30:37.160
and dim,

30:38.320 --> 30:40.080
I do not dare to slack off.

30:41.530 --> 30:43.040
I am afraid that as soon as I stop,

30:44.010 --> 30:45.890
numerous people will surpass me.

30:47.200 --> 30:48.610
One after another.

30:56.920 --> 30:57.970
Hello, Professor Ye.

30:58.440 --> 31:00.770
I am the son of Zhou Zongtang.

31:02.010 --> 31:03.160
You are Siyue, right?

31:04.250 --> 31:05.560
Zhou used to mention you.

31:06.010 --> 31:07.280
I finally get to meet you today.

31:07.970 --> 31:10.370
Yes. I heard it before

31:10.490 --> 31:12.010
that you and my dad are good friends.

31:12.200 --> 31:15.040
Sorry to bother you today.

31:15.320 --> 31:16.370
It is okay.

31:17.850 --> 31:19.160
Professor Ye,

31:21.320 --> 31:22.530
do you know

31:23.280 --> 31:25.010
what on earth happened to my dad?

31:32.080 --> 31:32.800
Ding Xian,

31:33.490 --> 31:34.320
you want to go to Huaqing University?

31:36.280 --> 31:36.890
Yes.

31:40.250 --> 31:41.010
Ding Xian,

31:42.080 --> 31:44.560
this year is neither short nor long.

31:45.440 --> 31:47.010
If your goal is Huaqing University,

31:47.440 --> 31:49.010
you may need to make more efforts

31:49.010 --> 31:50.970
than the others.

31:51.250 --> 31:52.250
I understand.

31:54.530 --> 31:55.370
I will.

31:57.010 --> 31:57.490
Hello.

31:57.560 --> 31:58.040
Hello.

31:58.160 --> 31:59.770
Zhou Zongtang's mail. Please sign for it.

32:01.040 --> 32:01.530
Thank you.

32:01.560 --> 32:02.080
Thank you.

32:03.530 --> 32:04.280
Let's eat.

32:07.160 --> 32:07.920
Mine?

32:09.370 --> 32:10.080
Yes.

32:25.970 --> 32:27.040
You continue eating. It's OK.

32:27.370 --> 32:28.370
I need to make a call.

32:33.400 --> 32:35.650
Mr. Wang,

32:36.080 --> 32:37.370
sorry for bothering you.

32:39.080 --> 32:41.490
Zhou's paper issued before

32:42.160 --> 32:44.250
was reported for copying and counterfeiting.

32:45.280 --> 32:47.440
He is being investigated now.

32:50.610 --> 32:51.490
Siyue

32:52.680 --> 32:53.560
What are you thinking about now?

32:54.160 --> 32:55.010
Eat.

32:57.200 --> 32:57.970
You too.

33:01.160 --> 33:02.250
I have thought it through.

33:03.370 --> 33:05.280
I will wait unit the truth comes out.

33:19.130 --> 33:19.800
Dad

33:21.850 --> 33:22.850
What is going on?

33:26.040 --> 33:27.770
I have experienced hypoglycemia lately.

33:27.920 --> 33:29.650
A doctor prescribed some medicines to me.

33:30.130 --> 33:31.080
Rest assured.

33:32.560 --> 33:33.730
Go have some rest.

33:36.440 --> 33:37.130
Dad

33:38.650 --> 33:40.280
I went to see Professor Ye today.

33:49.370 --> 33:50.080
I know

33:51.370 --> 33:52.400
you are afraid

33:52.850 --> 33:54.370
that I will be affected in school.

33:55.440 --> 33:56.490
But I am not afraid.

33:57.850 --> 33:58.560
I believe you.

34:05.440 --> 34:06.040
Sorry.

34:08.920 --> 34:10.250
I brought troubles to you and mom.

34:12.290 --> 34:13.770
We are family.

34:16.200 --> 34:17.770
You don't need to say things like this.

34:21.600 --> 34:22.400
Besides,

34:22.920 --> 34:25.330
you are not the only professor in Huaqing University.

34:26.089 --> 34:27.770
Perhaps nobody knows you,

34:28.600 --> 34:29.770
nor me.

34:32.879 --> 34:33.839
You have not eaten, right?

34:34.839 --> 34:36.160
I'll warm the dishes for you.

35:17.400 --> 35:17.970
Hello?

35:18.360 --> 35:19.010
Hello?

35:20.810 --> 35:21.570
Do you know

35:21.570 --> 35:23.360
your scores in the entrance exam today?

35:24.530 --> 35:25.250
How about it?

35:27.880 --> 35:28.810
Fine.

35:29.840 --> 35:32.050
My rank is good.

35:33.200 --> 35:35.920
How come you think of calling me now?

35:36.360 --> 35:37.840
I just want to tell you

35:39.160 --> 35:40.680
that I have settled down here.

35:42.360 --> 35:44.810
I can go to my university tomorrow or the day after.

35:45.640 --> 35:46.600
You don't need to worry about me.

35:48.360 --> 35:48.920
How about you?

35:49.570 --> 35:50.570
How are you doing in school?

35:56.920 --> 35:57.400
Ding Xian

35:58.050 --> 35:58.770
What happened to you?

36:02.200 --> 36:03.360
I'm fine.

36:04.440 --> 36:06.200
The score and rank

36:06.970 --> 36:08.530
of this exam

36:09.400 --> 36:10.680
are kind of great.

36:12.530 --> 36:15.490
The teacher said that there's good chance that

36:17.400 --> 36:18.730
I could go to Huaqing.

36:20.770 --> 36:21.330
Right.

36:22.640 --> 36:23.730
When you go to Huaqing University,

36:24.090 --> 36:26.090
can you take some photos for me?

36:27.840 --> 36:29.200
Silly.

36:30.330 --> 36:31.440
Of course.

36:33.250 --> 36:35.600
I really want to know what Huaqing University is like.

36:37.640 --> 36:38.880
You will know when you are here.

36:40.770 --> 36:43.920
I hope things can go smoothly.

36:46.600 --> 36:48.730
Are you really all right?

36:52.200 --> 36:53.730
I'm just tired.

36:54.770 --> 36:55.680
Sleepy.

36:56.970 --> 36:58.440
Then go to sleep.

37:00.970 --> 37:02.680
Everything will be all right.

37:07.200 --> 37:08.730
Everything will be all right.

37:20.640 --> 37:21.440
Siyue

37:24.600 --> 37:25.120
Mom

37:26.090 --> 37:26.880
You haven't slept?

37:28.730 --> 37:29.810
I just finished washing the clothes

37:29.810 --> 37:31.570
and want to hang them up on the balcony.

37:32.490 --> 37:33.880
Why don't you sleep?

37:37.120 --> 37:38.970
Why are you putting these away?

37:40.730 --> 37:42.090
Just some useless things.

37:42.530 --> 37:43.400
I wonder whether I can sell them all.

37:44.050 --> 37:46.050
Aren't these your favorites?

37:47.440 --> 37:49.010
I liked them as a kid.

37:49.290 --> 37:50.440
But now I've grown up.

37:54.570 --> 37:55.250
Right, mom.

37:56.160 --> 37:57.640
Perhaps before the term starts,

37:58.200 --> 37:59.680
I need to go back to Shen Hai.

38:11.440 --> 38:12.330
Ding Juncong

38:13.440 --> 38:15.640
Did you stay up late all night and play video games?

38:16.200 --> 38:17.360
It's weekend.

38:18.160 --> 38:19.570
What's wrong with playing video games?

38:20.090 --> 38:21.880
You are about to go to junior high school.

38:22.810 --> 38:25.120
You need to focus on your study.

38:25.570 --> 38:27.770
If you study half as hard as your sister,

38:28.120 --> 38:29.290
I will never scold you.

38:29.360 --> 38:31.250
Sis studies too hard to be a normal guy.

38:31.360 --> 38:32.120
Nonsense.

38:33.050 --> 38:33.730
Xianxian

38:33.970 --> 38:36.090
You studied all night?

38:39.840 --> 38:41.920
A few days ago, Mr. Wang talked to me.

38:41.920 --> 38:43.160
He said you made a huge progress.

38:44.050 --> 38:44.920
You did very well in the exam.

38:45.160 --> 38:46.330
But I want to remind you,

38:46.640 --> 38:47.440
don't push yourself too hard.

38:47.880 --> 38:50.050
Make sure you get enough rest. Be careful with your health.

38:51.530 --> 38:52.290
I understand.

38:56.920 --> 38:57.840
I'm going back to my bedroom.

38:59.840 --> 39:01.090
Why did you eat so little?

39:01.250 --> 39:01.840
I'm full already.

39:04.090 --> 39:05.490
She can't continue this way.

39:05.680 --> 39:08.090
Her mental state is getting worse.

39:09.010 --> 39:10.920
I heard her talk in her sleep last night.

39:11.250 --> 39:12.530
She was reciting formulas in her dream.

39:13.810 --> 39:14.730
I don't know what to do now.

39:14.810 --> 39:16.570
Perhaps you can talk to her.

39:16.970 --> 39:17.530
No.

39:19.090 --> 39:20.530
I refused to let her study for another year back then.

39:20.770 --> 39:23.200
Because I was afraid that she would get stuck in it.

39:23.680 --> 39:25.010
What for?

39:25.090 --> 39:26.360
Fine, stop saying things like this.

39:26.360 --> 39:27.360
It is pointless.

39:28.010 --> 39:28.920
Then what should we do?

39:30.250 --> 39:31.330
I don't know what to do.

39:32.360 --> 39:33.600
Sis may listen to

39:34.010 --> 39:35.880
one guy.

39:36.400 --> 39:37.120
Who?

39:43.330 --> 39:44.330
Mom, I am not hungry.

39:44.330 --> 39:46.160
I won't have lunch. You don't need to wait for me.

39:46.680 --> 39:47.970
Xianxian, it's me.

39:56.400 --> 39:57.160
Su,

39:57.840 --> 39:59.200
didn't you go to Jiangling?

39:59.770 --> 40:01.090
I come by to visit Uncle and Aunt.

40:01.120 --> 40:02.120
And you.

40:02.970 --> 40:04.050
Go. Let's take a walk.

40:05.050 --> 40:06.970
Don't stay in the room all day studying.

40:11.360 --> 40:13.400
My parents asked you to come, didn't they?

40:16.120 --> 40:17.440
They worried about you.

40:19.810 --> 40:20.770
I am fine.

40:23.920 --> 40:24.920
Studying for another year

40:26.600 --> 40:27.530
must be hard, right?

40:30.640 --> 40:32.840
Many people live a harder life than me.

40:35.400 --> 40:37.120
It is nothing.

40:42.360 --> 40:43.050
Su

40:44.360 --> 40:45.360
Do you know?

40:48.200 --> 40:51.440
There is a girl called Lin You in my class.

40:52.880 --> 40:54.730
She has studied for three extra years.

40:55.970 --> 40:58.290
Every year, she wanted to go to Nanjing University.

40:59.330 --> 41:00.640
But every year, she did worse

41:01.360 --> 41:03.200
than her last year.

41:04.640 --> 41:07.290
I think she is the most serious

41:07.360 --> 41:08.770
and hard-working student in my class.

41:09.970 --> 41:12.200
However, the harder she learned, the worse result she got.

41:13.090 --> 41:14.330
Once, in my class,

41:14.570 --> 41:15.920
she got a mental breakdown.

41:15.920 --> 41:18.250
She tore all her books and papers apart.

41:22.920 --> 41:23.680
Studying for another year

41:26.730 --> 41:28.050
is really horrifying.

41:30.600 --> 41:31.200
Xianxian

41:33.530 --> 41:34.880
Do you really think like this?

41:38.090 --> 41:38.840
Actually,

41:39.970 --> 41:41.250
if you are tired,

41:42.360 --> 41:44.200
and stop to have some rest,

41:46.330 --> 41:47.490
nobody will blame you.

41:53.840 --> 41:54.640
Su,

41:57.570 --> 41:58.640
I'm so tired.

41:59.840 --> 42:01.440
I'm really so tired.
